se,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"SHfz0"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3fff029d-8447-4f7e-91da-4dd9fee91026","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"\u003chttps://github.com/sublimelsp/LSP-volar\u003e","ts":"1629943077.005100","attachments":[{"color":"24292f","fallback":"sublimelsp/LSP-volar","id":1,"title":"sublimelsp/LSP-volar","text":"Vue support for Sublime's LSP plugin","fields":[{"title":"Stars","value":"2","short":true},{"title":"Language","value":"Python","short":true}],"blocks":null}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"bqWe"}]},{"client_msg_id":"93e5d583-920a-4dee-b230-a39811d198c9","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"ちなみに sublime では何やら動いたきたかもって感じになっているようです。\u003chttps://github.com/johnsoncodehk/volar/discussions/393\u003e","ts":"1629943053.004900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"vDuQ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0cf6d8d5-2493-4d83-a377-be5d8e895183","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"あと、最近わかったことだと、 volar は 3つのサーバーをプロセスを立ち上げる必要があるのですが *1つ* でも良いようです(3つ立ち上げてるのはパフォーマンスやブロックが発生しないように用途で分散んしているとのことのよう)。ただ1つは推奨しないと...。","ts":"1629942929.004200","edited":{"user":"U7TMPGWJ0","ts":"1629943111.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruhodo","count":1,"users":["U7FL0Q71D"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ZV="}]},{"client_msg_id":"b9453c2a-4039-4bcf-82a6-6a4d0b9cc64d","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"volar のですが、一ヶ月くらいやってみてなのですが。 現在 volar 自体がめまぐるしく変更があります。例えば Language Server の起動時に渡す initialization options も短いスパンで数回変わってますし。最近まで volar では tsconfig.json or jsconfig.json がないと起動しなかったのですが不要になったりと諸々。ただ、これらは勿論、必要があり変わってます(新機能追加等)\n\nあとはそもそも現在の vue は Option API, Composition API, `\u0026lt;script setup\u0026gt;` といった複数の書き方があり、且つ、vue2 (vue2 で正しく使う場合はパッケージの追加が必要) なのか vue3 なのか、 ts なのか js なのかでも変わるので...。更には vue 本体自体のバージョンアップでの新機能(シンタックスシュガーの追加など)も平行してあったりするので追従したりと。\n\nvolar の作者さんも VSCode ユーザの雑多な issue 対応もあるので、もうちょっと落ち着かないと vim-lsp や vim-lsp-settings で追加するなどは早すぎるかもしれません。","ts":"1629942823.003800","thread_ts":"1629905406.186200","edited":{"user":"U7TMPGWJ0","ts":"1629943559.000000"},"subtype":"thread_broadcast","reactions":[{"name":"+1","count":3,"users":["U7FL0Q71D","UEACRCY0Z","U03C6TEAZ"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"UclPC"}],"root":{"client_msg_id":"92b85e60-cb6b-4fb1-891b-964aabed4bfe","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"volar は standalone 化するつもり無さそうね。 \u003chttps://github.com/johnsoncodehk/volar/issues/63\u003e","ts":"1629905406.186200","thread_ts":"1629905406.186200","attachments":[{"color":"cb2431","fallback":"\u003chttps://github.com/johnsoncodehk/volar/issues/63|#63 standalone LSP support?\u003e","id":1,"title":"\u003chttps://github.com/johnsoncodehk/volar/issues/63|#63 standalone LSP support?\u003e","text":"hey, thanks for volar it's very nice\n\nIs it possible to run volar as a standalone LSP server? (for use with eg. vim/emacs/sublimetext LSP clients)  \nI image the functionality would be not 100% complete with the VS code plugin but just wondering if it's possible?\n\nthanks!","fields":[{"title":"Labels","value":"question","short":true},{"title":"Comments","value":"3","short":true}],"mrkdwn_in":["text"],"blocks":null,"footer":"\u003chttps://github.com/johnsoncodehk/volar|johnsoncodehk/volar\u003e","footer_icon":"https://slack.github.com/static/img/favicon-neutral.png","ts":1613417847}],"reply_count":1,"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"097"}]}},{"client_msg_id":"8f56a930-55f1-438f-a2ce-48cd22bbb800","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"shebangはむしろnodeが隆興したことで発生っていう感じですけど、まあそうですよね","ts":"1629940971.003000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"tjtxW"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b396d76c-e648-4746-99ab-1078f8196ec6","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"PHP「ﾅｶｰﾏ」","ts":"1629940771.002500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"7H7"}]},{"client_msg_id":"72e6984a-9e88-42d8-bc7c-f3e8a84e23d5","type":"message","user":"U0238G3KV8D","text":"やはりJSは「歴史的理由で残ってる仕様」が多すぎる 仕方ないけど","ts":"1629940750.002200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"QrR"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4dad6490-640f-4b8c-a627-d94ae9381e9b","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"\u003chttps://qiita.com/rana_kualu/items/3ec7a5fdf6a62fd6eecb\u003e\nあー...","ts":"1629940463.001400","attachments":[{"fallback":"Qiita: JavaScriptのコメントは4種類ある - Qiita","id":1,"title":"JavaScriptのコメントは4種類ある - Qiita","title_link":"https://qiita.com/rana_kualu/items/3ec7a5fdf6a62fd6eecb","text":"JavaScriptのコメントは//と/* */の2種類である、というのはよく知られた話です。 嘘です。 4種類あります。 // 1行コメントです。 let a = 1; // ここから行末までコメント 誰もが使った...","image_url":"https://qiita-user-contents.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.qiita.com%2Fassets%2Fpublic%2Farticle-ogp-background-1150d8b18a7c15795b701a55ae908f94.png?ixlib=rb-4.0.0\u0026w=1200\u0026mark64=aHR0cHM6Ly9xaWl0YS11c2VyLWNvbnRlbnRzLmltZ2l4Lm5ldC9-\u0026mark-align=center%2Cmiddle\u0026blend64=aHR0cHM6Ly9xaWl0YS11c2VyLWNvbnRlbnRzLmltZ2l4Lm5ldC9-dGV4dD9peGxpYj1yYi00LjAuMCZ3PTg0MCZoPTUwMCZ0eHQ2ND1RSEpoYm1GZmEzVmhiSFUmdHh0LWNvbG9yPSUyMzMzMyZ0eHQtZm9udD1IaXJhZ2lubyUyMFNhbnMlMjBXNiZ0eHQtc2l6ZT00NSZ0eHQtYWxpZ249cmlnaHQlMkNib3R0b20mcz1jYmJkYTJjNjkyZTk0NDU0ZjAxNGRjYzBlNWJkOWU1MQ\u0026blend-align=center%2Cmiddle\u0026blend-mode=normal\u0026s=a63f11a0797a3f282328c112c1fc8c4a","blocks":null,"service_name":"Qiita","service_icon":"https://cdn.qiita.com/assets/favicons/public/apple-touch-icon-ec5ba42a24ae923f16825592efdc356f.png","from_url":"https://qiita.com/rana_kualu/items/3ec7a5fdf6a62fd6eecb","original_url":"https://qiita.com/rana_kualu/items